# The repo is LF, and the container reads these files byte for byte: a CRLF
# Dockerfile leaves a \r at the end of every continued RUN line, which the shell
# inside the image reports as a missing file, and a CRLF .sh breaks its shebang.
# core.autocrlf is on for Windows checkouts, so pin the line ending here instead
# of relying on the local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats are never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
